Evidence in this folder: what is whose

The folders evidence-2026-09-26/, evidence-2026-09-28/, evidence-2026-09-30/,
evidence-2026-10-01/ and evidence-2026-10-06/ hold the responses that CSOAI Ltd
read from Pulse Labs OpCo LLC's public URLs (the key ring file, /pubkey and the
keyless BTC, ETH and SOL samples).

- The response bodies (keyring.json, pubkey.json, sample_*.json) and the
  response headers (*.headers, *.headers.json) are bytes served by Pulse's
  public URLs. They are reproduced here unmodified, as evidence, so that anyone
  can re-run the check. They are not covered by this repository's licence.
- verify_result.json, RECHECK.json, fetch_times.txt and *.meta were written by
  CSOAI Ltd, as was verify_pulse.py.

The record that cites these files is ../claimreg-pulse-verity-2026-10-06.json.
